MODULE: RepairRetryReplacesCapture
TARGET: CaptureFrozen
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a retry replaces a participant's first persisted repair payload
PERTURBS: Retry

--- FIND
Retry(v) ==
    /\ Live /\ v \in Fresh
    /\ UNCHANGED vars
--- REPLACE
Retry(v) ==
    /\ Live /\ v \in Fresh
    /\ captured' = [captured EXCEPT ![v] = IF @ = 1 THEN 2 ELSE 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<legacy,registered,decided,applied,degraded,source,bound,rows,target,
                   first,firstTarget,repairDecided,repairApplied,reported,stage,
                   observed,retired,acknowledged,cleared,faults,ordinarySeen,
                   snapshotRows,snapshotOrdinary>>
--- END
